      "writtenOn": "2023-08-29T04:43:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The doc for LEANBACK suggests not all TVs support it. Did you want FEATURE_TELEVISION ? Or, is there a way to know if the device is always connected to power ? (I guess that means : do you want to enable this on U on devices like google home)",
